					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A teleporting, predatory manhole cover that transmutes humans into rats? Item A, Power B. After you've been through the main list a time or two you've seen a lot of these.</p> <p>What saves this one for me is the experiment log, especially when the pad and pen are introduced.</p> 
